// Title: Suspicious Diantz Download and Compress Into a CAB File
// Sigma ID: 185d7418-f250-42d0-b72e-0c8b70661e93
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2021-11-26 | Modified: 2022-08-13
// ATT&CK: command-and-control, T1105
// Description: Download and compress a remote file and store it in a cab file on local machine.
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Diantz/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_diantz_remote_cab.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessCommandLine contains "diantz.exe" and ProcessCommandLine contains " \\\\" and ProcessCommandLine contains ".cab"
